只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A native macOS workspace for local and remote coding agents. Conversations, tools, approvals and tasks — with Kimi, Codex and more.","id":"gh:1379341929","install_available":false,"language":"Swift","name":"perch","slug":"chenweigao/perch","topics":["acp","agent-client-protocol","ai-agents","coding-agent","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","kimi","llm-tools","macos","ssh","swiftui"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A native macOS workspace for local and remote coding agents. Conversations, tools, approvals and tas"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ks — with Kimi, Codex and more."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"Perch\nA home for your coding agents.\nA native Mac workspace for local and remote agent workflows.\nEn"},{"id":"p2s2","text":"glish · 简体中文 · Get started · Project status"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Run Kimi or Codex on your Mac, or connect to supported agents over SSH. Perch brings\nconversations, "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"tasks, tool output and approvals into one native workspace, so you\ncan read the result, inspect the "},{"id":"p3s3","text":"work and decide what happens next."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Built with SwiftUI, AppKit and Ghostty, with native text editing, keyboard shortcuts\nand system Liqu"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"id Glass on macOS 26."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| Start with context | Keep the work in view |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| [](docs/images/perch-new-session.png) | [](docs/images/perch-tool-details.png) |\n| Pick a project,"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" model and reasoning effort. Keep permissions close at hand. | Read the answer first; inspect task d"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"etails in the integrated right panel. |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"*Rendered UI illustrations with synthetic demo data; these are not native screenshots or live comman"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"d results.\nLight appearance · Dark appearance · Work in progress · Asset sources*"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Why Perch"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **Native conversations.** Streaming replies, Markdown (including TeX math typeset natively by Swif"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"tMath), thinking and tool results, with details that expand when you need them.\n- **Start with the r"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ight context.** Choose a local or remote environment, search recent projects, and select model, reas"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"oning effort and permissions before sending.\n- **A workspace for your tasks.** Group sessions, pin i"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"mportant work, archive finished conversations and return to your previous workspace.\n- **Know what n"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"eeds you.** See running tasks, pending questions and results waiting to be read, plus Kimi's subagen"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"ts (including their own transcripts), background tasks with their output tails, and the session's ed"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"it churn (+/− per file) in the activity bar.\n- **Keep your CLI workflow.** Use native chat for suppo"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"rted agents and Ghostty terminals for CLI sessions through Herdr.\n- **Inspect the work.** Read Markd"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"own, source, images, PDF, tables and standalone HTML, then inspect Git changes alongside the convers"},{"id":"p9s11","text":"ation (experimental).\n- **Keep projects moving.** Project goals and outcomes, a floating companion, "},{"id":"p9s12","text":"scoped search, revision-bound delivery records and one-time follow-ups. See workspace workflows for "},{"id":"p9s13","text":"limits and background behavior.\n- **Remote execution, local control.** Files and tools run on your s"},{"id":"p9s14","text":"erver. Closing the Mac app leaves managed remote sessions running.\n- **Explicit permission modes.** "},{"id":"p9s15","text":"Choose adapter-specific defaults and per-task overrides; high-risk modes require confirmation. Kimi,"},{"id":"p9s16","text":" Qoder and Claude Code can change for a later message or turn, while OMP and Codex are fixed when a "},{"id":"p9s17","text":"ode can change for a later message or turn, while OMP and Codex are fixed when a session is created."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Agent connections"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Agent / workflow | Connection | Experience |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Kimi Code | Kimi Web API over SSH | Native conversation |\n| Oh My Pi (OMP) | RPC through the remot"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"e bridge | Native conversation |\n| Qoder CN | Official Agent SDK through the remote bridge | Native "},{"id":"p12s3","text":"conversation |\n| Qoder | Official Agent SDK through the remote bridge | Native conversation |\n| Clau"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"de Code | Official Agent SDK through the remote bridge | Native conversation |\n| DeepSeek Harness (d"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"sh) | ACP through the remote bridge | Native conversation |\n| Codex | `codex app-server` JSON-RPC ov"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"er stdio through the remote bridge | Native conversation |\n| Other CLI agents | Herdr + SSH | Termin"},{"id":"p12s7","text":"tdio through the remote bridge | Native conversation |\n| Other CLI agents | Herdr + SSH | Terminal |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Native integrations share the same conversation UI. Additional RPC, SDK or ACP\nadapters are welcome;"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" arbitrary protocol compatibility is not automatic.\nSee Kimi setup and OMP / Qoder CN / Qoder / dsh "},{"id":"p13s3","text":"/ Codex / Claude Code setup\nfor tested versions and recovery limits. Agent credentials and model con"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"figuration\nstay with the CLI; Perch does not connect directly to model providers."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Local Kimi and Codex conversations are available; other local agents remain\ndiscovery-only. See loca"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"l agents. Kimi, remote OMP and Codex support steering during a running task, with an\nexplicit next-t"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"urn option. Codex keeps its native thread ID and history, takes model\nand reasoning-effort choices f"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"rom `model/list`, and surfaces every app-server approval\nor question for an explicit response. Qoder"},{"id":"p14s5","text":" CN / Qoder / dsh / Claude Code support stopping and next-turn\nqueueing. Pending messages appear in "},{"id":"p14s6","text":"the conversation until runtime history confirms\nthem. Existing Herdr sessions remain terminal sessio"},{"id":"p14s7","text":" conversation until runtime history confirms\nthem. Existing Herdr sessions remain terminal sessions."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Download"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Grab the zipped app from Releases. The\napp is ad-hoc signed (no Apple notarization): on first launch"},{"id":"p16s2","text":", right-click → Open."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Build and run"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Requires macOS 26+ and a Swift toolchain with the macOS 26 SDK (Xcode 26 or newer).\nThe current buil"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"d has been tested on Apple Silicon. A remote SSH host and the\ncorresponding agent runtime are requir"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"ed for remote sessions."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"For local work, start with local Kimi or Codex setup.\nFor remote work, choose **Connect a remote mac"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"hine** on the home screen, or **Environment → +**.\nThe setup wizard verifies SSH, checks your chosen"},{"id":"p20s3","text":" agent, offers installation and\nlogin actions, then lets you browse a remote directory and start you"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"r first task.\nKimi's port and token-file path are editable in Advanced settings. Fresh installs\nstar"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"t without a preset host. See the setup guide."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"`⌘N` new conversation · `⌘K` search · `⌃⌥P` companion · `Return` send · `Shift Return` new line"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The interface follows the system language, with 简体中文 and English available\nunder Settings → Language"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"; the sidebar and its flows are bilingual first, other\nareas may still mix languages while translati"},{"id":"p22s3","text":" and its flows are bilingual first, other\nareas may still mix languages while translations catch up."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Status"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Early source preview. Long-session responsiveness and recovery still need work;\nthis is not a stable"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" release. File previews and Git review/write workflows are experimental. Support varies by agent; ch"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"eck the adapter documentation before\nrelying on a workflow. Builds use local ad-hoc signing; notariz"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"ed downloads are\nnot available yet."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Contributing"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Bug reports, focused fixes and agent adapters are welcome. Start with\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

